    Los Angeles Superior Court
    Court Case No: 24STCP01290

3) Name of Case: SC Group 3400 Fletcher, LLC v. City of Manhattan Beach, et al.                                                  
    Los Angeles Superior Court 
    Court Case No: 25TRCP00353


II.. RECESS INTO CLOSED SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 5:02 PM, the City Council recessed into Closed Session.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\par
}


III.. RECONVENE INTO OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:00 PM, the City Council reconvened into Open Session with all City Councilmembers present. \i0\fs24\par
\cf1\par
}


IV.. CLOSED SESSION ANNOUNCEMENT IN OPEN SESSION {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\i\fs22 City Attorney Quinn Barrow announced that the City Council went into Closed Session pursuant to the Brown Act on three separate items identified on the agenda. The City Council gave direction with respect to all three items.\i0\fs24\par
\pard\cf1\par
}


G.. ADJOURNMENT {\rtf1\ansi\ansicpg1252\deff0\deflang1033{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 Arial;}}
{\colortbl ;\red0\green0\blue0;}
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\i\fs22 At 6:01 PM, Mayor Franklin adjourned the meeting.\i0\fs24\par
\cf1\par
}


